  "content": "\n\n<p>Sunbathing 是一个简单的资源包，添加了太阳和月亮的光柱效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这些效果为简单的屏幕空间光柱，得益于 Polytone，它们可通过原版后处理着色器正常运行。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>需要安装 Polytone</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1606/475/2026-03-30_22.png\" alt=\"光柱效果\" width=\"1291\" height=\"664\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://c.tenor.com/5GdQEu3luVUAAAAC/tenor.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"498\" height=\"280\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/788/551/polytone_banner2.png\" alt=\"需要安装 Polytone\" width=\"800\" height=\"293\"></p>",
